Z||000000||btoth||10-10-2000||12:18 PM||||would a chocolate easter bunny that has been in the refrigerator since april still be good or should it be avoided??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000001||Songman||10-10-2000||01:10 PM||||If wedding cake can be eaten at anniversaries I'm sure a chocolate bunny would be good! Go for it! hehe||||reg||1
Z||000002||deceler8||10-10-2000||01:14 PM||||Eat it. <P>Chocolate pretty much can be stored at room temp. for a year or so and be okay.<P>Now if it had been in the trunk of your car since April...||||reg||1
