Z||000006||My7Fieros||10-10-2000||09:39 PM||||Go to your local Mapco Express, (or 7-11, Rite Aid, whatever the big convinience store chain in your area is)...see those Chocodiles and Pink snowballs there? How long do you think they've been there?!<BR>Im sure its fine...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000007||deceler8||10-11-2000||10:53 AM||||Many years ago, I inadvertently ate a can of bean dip that was six years past its expiration date. I wouldn't have known anything, but as I was eating it, I noticed the bottom of the can was rusting out from the inside.<P>No ill effects at the time, even though I recall this was during the botulism scare.<P>I still have a stash of 10 year old MRE's that I occasionally eat, and they taste just like they did 10 years ago.||||reg||1
