Z||000015||deceler8||10-14-2000||09:21 AM||||Hey Monkey...maybe I'm nuts, but I always liked the MRE's. Kinda on a par with TV dinners...ya'know...sometimes they're better than home cooking.<P>I've let several WW2 and Korea vets I know eat one of the MRE's, and they're impressed compared to what they had to suffer with then. The little bottles of Tabasco and the M&M's in some of the MRE's really blow their minds.||||reg||1
